# Historical 2.0 release-candidate review machinery is retained locally for
# audit provenance.  The stable software repository exposes only the active
# package release path and must not accidentally republish these private
# approval packets, candidate payloads, or superseded workflows.
/.github/workflows/publish-github-release.yml
/.github/workflows/publish-testpypi.yml
